{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"助監督","text":"今の動線でオッケーです！\r\n本番いきまーす","trans":"刚才的动线可以！\n正式开拍——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"制作スタッフ１","text":"……先輩\r\nやばくないですか、冬優子ちゃん","trans":"……前辈\n冬优子是不是太厉害了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"制作スタッフ２","text":"初出演で台本持たない子、初めて見た","trans":"第一次出演就不拿剧本的人，我第一次见","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………頑張れ、冬優子","trans":"…………加油，冬优子","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"助監督","text":"シーン80……！\r\nよーい──────","trans":"第80场……！\n准备──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"俳優１","text":"『ユウコ\r\n大丈夫か？』","trans":"“优子\n没事吧？”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040020","name":"冬優子","text":"『…………っ\r\nはい…………』","trans":"“…………唔\n是…………”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-22","name":"俳優１","text":"『行こう\r\nあっちで休んで────』","trans":"“走吧\n去那边休息────”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-29","name":"俳優２","text":"『ま、待ってくれ……！』","trans":"等、等一下……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-37","name":"助監督","text":"いやー、すごいっすね","trans":"哎呀，真厉害啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-39","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え？","trans":"诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-40","name":"助監督","text":"黛さん\r\nあの若さで、他に全然負けてないから","trans":"黛\n那么年轻，完全不输给其他人","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-42","name":"助監督","text":"２８３さん、俳優部門もやってみたらどうです？\r\nなーんて","trans":"283要不要也搞搞演员部门？\n开个玩笑","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-43","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは、どうでしょう……\r\nまだこれからというところですので","trans":"哈哈，怎么说呢……\n现在才刚要开始","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-44","name":"助監督","text":"えー、もったいない","trans":"诶——太可惜了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-46","name":"助監督","text":"────ていうか\r\nちょっと天才かもしんない","trans":"────话说\n说不定有点天才","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-47","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………\r\nそんなに、ですか……？","trans":"…………\n有那么厉害吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-48","name":"助監督","text":"────……はい？","trans":"────……啊？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-49","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────えっ\r\nあ、いや…………","trans":"────诶\n啊，不…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-51","name":"助監督","text":"あの、言っちゃあれですけど────","trans":"那个，说出来可能有点那个────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-52","name":"助監督","text":"なんでアイドルやってるのか\r\nわかんないくらいですよ","trans":"会让人不懂\n她为什么在当偶像","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-73","name":"プロデューサー","text":"輝いてる","trans":"在闪耀","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-80","name":"プロデューサー","text":"誰よりも","trans":"比谁都","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-84","name":"プロデューサー","text":"この場所で","trans":"在这个地方","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040030","name":"冬優子","text":"…………何やってんの","trans":"…………你在干什么","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040040","name":"冬優子","text":"ボーッと突っ立って…………\r\nみんなとっくに休憩入ってるわよ","trans":"呆呆地站着…………\n大家早就开始休息了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-100","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────そっか\r\nありがとな…………","trans":"────这样啊\n谢了…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040050","name":"冬優子","text":"ふゆが頑張ってるとこ\r\nちゃんと見てなかったの？","trans":"我努力的样子\n你没好好看吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-102","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────……\r\nそんなことない……！","trans":"────……\n不是的……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-103","name":"プロデューサー","text":"もちろん見てたぞ\r\n……さすがだった","trans":"当然看了\n……真不愧是你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040060","name":"冬優子","text":"言ったでしょ\r\nきっちりやり切るって","trans":"我说过吧\n会好好做到的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-105","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ…………\r\nやっぱりすごいな、冬優子は","trans":"嗯…………\n果然厉害啊，冬优子","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-106","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………本当に……","trans":"…………真的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040070","name":"冬優子","text":"…………何？\r\nあんたも映画に出たかった？","trans":"…………怎么？\n你也想演电影？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-108","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────……えっ！？","trans":"────……诶！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040080","name":"冬優子","text":"あんたも入っちゃえば？\r\n────カメラの中","trans":"你也进去算了？\n────进到镜头里","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-111","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いやいや、演者じゃないんだから……\r\n俺にはそんな資格────","trans":"不不，我又不是演员……\n我没那个资格────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040090","name":"冬優子","text":"……ばーか\r\n冗談よ","trans":"……笨蛋\n开玩笑的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040100","name":"冬優子","text":"向こうでお弁当配ってるって","trans":"听说那边在发便当","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2018014040110","name":"冬優子","text":"行きましょ","trans":"走吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}